            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p> <span data-inline-latex=\"(-5;-4)\\cup (-4;-3)\\cup [-\\frac{2}{3};\\frac{1-\\sqrt{13}}{6})\\cup (\\frac{1+\\sqrt{13}}{6};1]\"></span> . </p>",
