            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Рас­смот­рим два слу­чая. </p><p>Пер­вый слу­чай: <span data-inline-latex=\"0\\lt (x+4)^{2}\\lt 1\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}-5\\lt x\\lt -4\\\\-4\\lt x\\lt -3\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> .  </p><p>Тогда <span data-inline-latex=\"3x^{2}-x-1\\ge 1\\iff (3x+2)(x-1)\\ge 0\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x\\le -\\frac{2}{3}\\\\x\\ge 1\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> .  </p><p>При <span data-inline-latex=\"0\\lt (x+4)^{2}\\lt 1\"></span> по­лу­ча­ем  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left[\\begin{aligned}-5\\lt x\\lt -4\\\\-4\\lt x\\lt -3\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> .  </p><p>Вто­рой слу­чай:  <span data-inline-latex=\"(x+4)^{2}\\gt 1\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x\\lt -5\\\\x\\gt -3\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p><p>Тогда </p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}3x^{2}-x-1\\gt 0{,}3x^{2}-x-1\\le 1\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}(x-\\frac{1-\\sqrt{13}}{6})(x-\\frac{1+\\sqrt{13}}{6})\\gt 0\\\\(3x+2)(x-1)\\le 0\\end{cases}\"></span> . </p></center><p>от­ку­да  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{2}{3}\\le x\\lt \\frac{1-\\sqrt{13}}{6}\\\\\\frac{1+\\sqrt{13}}{6}\\lt x\\le 1\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> .  </p><p>Най­ден­ные ре­ше­ния удо­вле­тво­ря­ют усло­вию  <span data-inline-latex=\"(x+4)^{2}\\gt 1\"></span>.</p><p>Ре­ше­ние ис­ход­но­го не­ра­вен­ства:  <span data-inline-latex=\"(-5;-4)\\cup (-4;-3)\\cup [-\\frac{2}{3};\\frac{1-\\sqrt{13}}{6})\\cup (\\frac{1+\\sqrt{13}}{6};1]\"></span> . </p>",
